data/
# …but not the data layer's code (CB-110), nor a data/ folder inside the apps
# (the native app and its push relay), where it holds code, not databases.
!packages/data/
!apps/**/data/
# The ontology's knowledge graph is Turtle, not a database.
!ontology/data/
*.sqlite
*.sqlite-shm
*.sqlite-wal

# Local hosted-project selection
.copilotkit/

# Agent state stays local (Claude Code worktrees and settings). Shared agent
# instructions live in AGENTS.md and .agents/; .claude/skills and CLAUDE.md
# are symlinks to them for Claude Code.
.claude/*
!.claude/skills

# Erden's installed layers (erden install); erden.lock is committed.
ontology/.erden/
# The checks' facts (pnpm ontology:graph): large, and regenerated from the tree.
ontology/audit/
